# The retained primitives in packages/python/type-construction-world need no runtime
# configuration, and nothing in this tree reads an environment variable. Copy this file to .env
# only if you want the optional development telemetry below; .env is ignored by git and is not
# touched by any change to this file.

# Optional development telemetry. Nothing in this tree emits traces today. The dev service in
# compose.yaml sets these standard OpenTelemetry variables so that any tool run in it that does
# emit traces exports them to the local Jaeger at http://localhost:16686. With no exporter
# named, nothing leaves the process.
# OTEL_TRACES_EXPORTER=otlp
# OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_PROTOCOL=http/protobuf
# OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:4318
